<title>USA: Suzuki June US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Suzuki June US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		  47		 231	    -79.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     339		 531	    -36.2</p>
<p> Import Car		   352		 496	    -29.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,067	     1,052	     +1.4</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 788	     2,214	    -64.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,390	     4,055	    -40.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,065	     3,193	    +28.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	     7,498	     7,129	     +5.9</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
